00:34:33,040 --> 00:34:35,860
In exchange, the beggars would pray for the household's dead.

482
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:41,280
Scholars still debate whether or not American trick-or-treating is based on this tradition,

483
00:34:41,281 --> 00:34:43,092
